WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.980
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:12.440
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.320
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.620
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.290
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:09.110
This is the pride of the Yokohama Police, the Phantom Thief Incident Investigation Team "Genius 4."

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:12.380
It consists of four people, and this is G4's Akechi Kokoro-san.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.270
Ugh, Akechi the Idiot.

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:16.460
Kokoro-chan! It's me, Sher!

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.320
Um, what exactly did you want to show us?

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:21.660
You'll soon find out.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:25.670
It seems that you've received an advance notice from Phantom Thief Arsène about her next heist, right?

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:26.640
Yes.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:31.560
However, Phantom Thief Arsène was the one that even Milky Holmes couldn't catch,

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.700
so just how confident are you in catching her?

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:37.050
Milky Holmes? Don't group me in with such a useless bunch!

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:40.700
U-Um...

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:46.770
My apologies. We, G4, shall capture Phantom Thief Arsène for sure.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:50.270
All you walking headaches need to do is rot in that attic and eat dusty snacks!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.390
Ahh, I see, thank you very much...

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:55.070
"Headaches..."

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.150
Rage!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:02.040
I see, so this was what Henriette-sama planned.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.910
Remind Milky Holmes just how useless they are,

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.300
and then shred their pride to pieces.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:11.830
That's Henriette-sama for you. Excellent, smart, and cyber.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:12.910
Cyber?

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.590
Cybwah~

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.460
Are we really going in?

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:26.950
Of course! We'll let them know just who the "headaches" are here!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.890
Now, let's get to capturing!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:38.570
You idiots are beyond salvation!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:49.410
Kokoro-chan, we saw you on TV! Must've felt great, eh?

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:51.830
Don't call me Kokoro-chan!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:53.890
Sher!

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.500
You're still hung up on that...

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.800
Try not to step on these works of art, okay?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.590
Why did you all come here in the first place?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.480
We came to help!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.480
If there's phantom thieves around, then so are detectives!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.180
We should also have the right of protecting the Venus de Hama!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:11.310
There are no rights for people with no Toys!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:15.000
It'd be a different story if your Toys had returned, though...

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.490
Ah, that's it...

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.080
I recalled a way for you to get your Toys back!

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.950
Ehh?! Really?!

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.790
There exists Toys within the shadows of history.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.900
Ever since Moses parted the raging Red Sea, as if by some utter miracle,

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:36.210
or even back to the eerie mummies in ancient Egypt,

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.960
Toys have always been around us.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.970
That Pharaoh's lithograph shall only yield its secrets to those who touch it.

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:45.530
Now, let's continue.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.370
Right hand, blue!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.070
Left foot, yellow!

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.040
Left hand, green!

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:59.080
Right foot, red!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:06.370
C-Can this really bring back our Toys?

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:09.070
Kokoro-chan never says anything wrong!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:12.980
I'm the brains of G4, graduated from Harvard University at the age of 13.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:16.990
There is no character that the once-admired genius, Akechi Kokoro, cannot read!

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.210
You can read characters like that?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.620
"In order to cool herself off from the heat of the day,

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.830
Sayoko went to the local supermarket,

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.430
where she met her ex from her school days, Satoru, by coincidence."

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:33.180
Her IQ really was at 1300!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:37.770
If you follow what I say, you can decipher the code hidden in that lithograph!

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:44.280
It's so kind of Kokoro to actually show them how to get back their Toys!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.680
She must be lying...

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:49.870
She just wants some revenge, since they get in our way all the time, right?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:52.340
Got it, got it, got it, got it, got it, got it, got it!!

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:57.300
Kokoro-sensei, what did you just get?

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.880
Everyone, left foot, blue!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.400
Somehow it feels like my Toys is coming back to me...

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:12.170
Me too! I also started feeling that earlier.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:15.630
Me too. My body is getting warmer...

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:21.700
Herc, you too? Now that you mention it, I feel like my body's heating up, too.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.790
Left hand, green!

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.530
Green... green!

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.250
"It's fine, isn't it? Isn't it?"

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.590
"Please forgive me!"

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:37.410
"It's fine! You just have to break up with that guy!"

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:41.020
I forgot to mention this,

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:43.910
but if any part of your body other than your legs and arms touches the lithograph,

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:46.250
it'll become impossible to decipher the code!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.270
<i>W-What'll I do...?</i>

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.940
Next is you.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.610
Right foot, blue.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.610
Eh? U-Um...

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.770
Do it now!

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:15.080
<i>If I put my right foot to blue like that...</i>

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.520
<i>No way!</i>

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.450
B-But...

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:21.290
Hurry!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.220
Please!

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:24.800
Y-Yes!

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.480
I-I'm sorry!!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.270
Idiot! What did you get off for?

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.480
My Toys is disappearing...

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.730
Kokoro-san, it's almost time.

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:56.010
Too bad! You were so close to getting them back, too!

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.280
Herc, you idiot!

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.160
I'm sorry...

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:05.990
Are we ready?

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:06.910
Tsugiko.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:07.370
Hirano.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:08.230
Saku.

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:09.550
From anywhere!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.870
Come at me!

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.670
Deployment is complete here.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.770
Damn! We were so close!

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:21.270
Why didn't you do what Akechi said?!

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:22.810
Well...

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.270
I'd bear the embarrassment if it would get me my Toys back!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.730
It was fun for me, too!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.980
How are you going to take responsibility if our Toys never come back?!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:35.570
I...

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:40.020
Let's stop it. Herc knows what she did was wrong.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.870
Now, let's go back to guarding.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.060
Everyone's so dispirited...

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:53.050
If this continues on, I've gotta blaze things up with my Fire...

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.270
Ahh! Dark! Dark!!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.060
Cordelia-san!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.310
So you've come, Phantom Thief Arsène!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.600
Everything she does is so flashy...

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.330
We'll capture you this time for sure!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:09.450
Prepare yourself!

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:15.040
Are you okay, Cordelia-san?!

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.570
She's afraid of the dark.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:19.630
I'm scared! Something's gonna appear!

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:22.630
Well, it wouldn't be strange if a ghost appeared, right?

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:25.580
Don't say such weird things!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:31.990
Here we go. Toys of Resplendence.

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.170
Hurry up with the lights!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.230
This is the best I can manage with my laptop's light...

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.230
Venus de Hama has been...!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.600
D-Disappeared?

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:56.870
But why?

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.800
They should still be nearby!

00:09:58.800 --> 00:09:59.570
I saw them!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.530
They're escaping through the southern exit!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.040
Nice!

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.140
We'll go, too!

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:09.190
I'm scared! I'm scared!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:14.960
Mission success.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:21.110
As expected of Arsène-sama. She made only Venus de Hama invisible with Toys of Resplendence.

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:22.930
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:35.530
The national treasure, Venus de Hama, is now ours!

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:41.660
Yahoo!

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:45.400
Rejoice while you still can, bastards.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.030
How's the tracking device?

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:49.160
Tracking now.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.300
It's fine now, Cordelia-san!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:58.260
Huh? This is... Where did they go?

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.760
With this, we can locate where their hideout is.

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:09.890
It's here!!

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.700
Wait, Cordelia-san!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.070
Watch out!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:24.030
What the hell have you done, you headache?!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.300
Wallow in regret there forever!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:33.290
You know, picturing you guys eating stinky food in that cell really fits you!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.720
What was that?!

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:35.660
Sorry bout this.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.510
<i>We're</i> the ones paying your bills, arrogant bastards!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.090
Ahh, it's white rice!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.110
Rice and miso soup!

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:46.500
No way...

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.790
They have such feasts here at detention cells?!

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:49.980
This is heaven!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.910
Itadakimasu!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:56.020
It seems that you've interfered with the police's search.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:12:00.630
My word. Just how useless can you lot be?

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:03.270
Student council president...? Why are you here?

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:11.080
I have come to bail you out. I cannot just leave the disgrace of our academy in here forever.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.600
We're leaving.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:13.920
Hey!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.840
Just one more bite!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.290
Yes, yes. Let's go now.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.950
Damn, we did this all for nothing.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:35.730
Even though they've lost their Toys, we still can't make light of Milky Holmes...

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:39.840
So this was the thing that Arsène-sama was worried about.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.580
Sheesh, what a terrible day.

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:48.700
My rice...

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.880
Ahh, this is the worst!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.610
Because of <i>someone's</i> fault, we couldn't get back our Toys!

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:57.330
Nero!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.010
It's true, isn't it?

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.970
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.310
Please wait!

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:04.790
You don't have to go after her.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:05.760
But...

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:09.780
It's fine if you leave her alone. Herc is so...

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.320
That tickles, Kamaboko!

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:31.120
It's almost midnight...

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:35.000
Where could Herc have gone at this late hour?

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.840
Aren't you worried about Herc-san?

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.020
Not really.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:44.010
Oh yeah, I gotta go out to fetch more water for Kamaboko.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.770
Wait for us, Nero!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.580
We'll go with you!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.630
It's fine, I'll go alone.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.840
Yes, yes.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:05.800
Hey! It really isn't like that!

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.450
Herc!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.660
Herc-san!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.030
Herc!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.430
Herc-san isn't here...

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:18.040
Herc probably feels responsible for it...

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:22.000
Maybe she thinks that it's her fault that we couldn't get our Toys back.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.840
Herc-san felt responsible for it, huh?

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.720
She's at Yokohama Museum!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:54.230
Since it's a fake, we didn't really have to go all the way back to return it, did we?

00:14:54.230 --> 00:15:00.080
Non! That would contradict the aesthetics of Arsène-sama. And my beautiful figure, too!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.960
Damn... where could the real one be?

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:06.520
Lucky! They're dozing off at the moment!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.760
They're really skilled at sleeping standing up!

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.720
All right, here's our chance!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.480
Left hand... yellow...

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:24.390
Right foot... blue...

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.400
Don't be embarrassed... because no one's watching...

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.530
Herc-san!

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:31.700
Herc!

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:35.820
I-I'll do my best next time, so...

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.450
Nero...

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:42.460
I said too much. Sorry, Herc.

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:59.470
A toast to such beautiful companionship!

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.660
Rabbit-san!

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:02.010
I told you, it's Rat!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:02.930
Phantom Thief-san!

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:03.940
You're doing it on purpose, aren't you?!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.600
Save those hugs and kisses for later.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.670
Why is 3-Cards here?

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:11.050
It's because you deceived us!

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.070
Deceived?

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.800
To think that you'd make us go after a fake...

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:15.780
Yes?

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.780
What are you saying? I don't get it.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.910
In that case, we'll make you understand!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:23.320
Accept my beautiful cards!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.750
I'm exhausted...

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.460
Eat this!

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.510
Better be prepared!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.790
Do it if you can!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.980
Ramune Shot!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.010
Huh? I don't have anymore?

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.450
Sorry, this'll have to do!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:56.470
Other one!

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:57.450
Rose!

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.660
Wait! Please!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.360
That's as far as you go!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:16.270
How dare you strip me naked.

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:21.510
Now, look closely at my beautiful body!

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:23.220
Don't show me!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.180
Why? Why won't you look?!

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:27.560
You're just like Nijuuri-sensei!

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:30.550
Come on... look at me with those eyes―

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:34.820
Twenty!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:35.710
Cordelia-san!

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:45.120
It's finally just the two of us, honey.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:49.170
Twenty, what are you doing to her?!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.230
Get out of there, Cordelia!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:58.240
In here, no one can stop us. Feel me up to your heart's content!

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:04.080
What'll we do?! At this rate, Cordelia-san will die!

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.910
It's not just dark, it's terrifying with Twenty in there!

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:08.560
Even I wouldn't be able to stand it!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.270
Their air is going to run out...

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:14.190
Wait for us, Twenty! We're coming to save you right now!

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.590
Don't hold back, honey!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:23.610
Yes... that spot... Ah, not there, honey!

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:26.500
Let me hear your moans, honey.

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:31.810
No good! It won't open!

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:34.280
Can't you guys do something with your Toys?!

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:36.390
Oh right! You're pretty smart!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.720
You're just really stupid!

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.770
Bombs don't work, huh...

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:50.630
Outta the way!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.860
Hiyah!

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:00.070
I'm done...

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:05.500
I'm done too... I'm so hungry that I can't move...

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.870
Me too...

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:12.600
Why won't it open?!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.290
Now, don't be afraid!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.420
If you keep doing this, I'll bite my tongue off!

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:19.800
Cordelia-san's gonna die!

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:23.340
I... don't want that!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.520
Toys... please, come out...

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.190
Sher...

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:38.000
Why...

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:44.660
S-Something's touching me...!

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:46.910
Hint number one:

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:47.870
It isn't a finger.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.950
Cordelia-san!!

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:58.000
Her Toys has...!

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:12.780
You did it! You did it, Herc! You got your Toys back!

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:13.690
All right!

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.670
We can do it if we put our minds to it!

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:25.820
Thank you very much for coming to my stage today! *Kiss*

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:27.860
Wear some clothes, retard!

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:28.880
Cordelia-san!

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:29.790
Cordelia!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:34.690
It's like she got old all of a sudden...

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:39.090
That mask... hard... hurts...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.590
Observe this smooth skin!

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:43.630
How long are you gonna keep doing that?! Get out!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.260
Non! I haven't taken off enough clothes!

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:48.410
Cut that out.

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:51.900
We'll let you off easy for now.

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:54.200
We won't hold back next time!

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.770
It doesn't feel like we won...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:11.780
No good...

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:15.410
But your Toys returned earlier, didn't it?

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:17.540
So that means...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.880
That's it! <i>That</i> must've worked!

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:26.290
R-Right foot... blue...

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:28.600
I did it... I did it!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:32.060
Ahh, I got it! It feels like it's coming back!

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:36.990
Let it permeate my body... permeate, permeate...

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:40.400
Next! What does the code say?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.940
You're too noisy! Stop doing that and help us clean up, you dimwits!

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:47.150
Haven't you noticed it was a lie, retards?!

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:20.600
Kokoro-chan, our Toys didn't come back!

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:23.540
Don't call me that! I've no time to play with you!

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:26.650
There's a girl that went missing in Yokohama Forest!

00:23:26.650 --> 00:23:28.500
Oh no! I'll go look for her too!

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:30.700
Uh, why did you start tying me to a tree?

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:32.780
Ah, it hurts! It's digging in, you know!

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:34.300
Hold still, damn it! Hold still!

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:35.640
Don't interrupt!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:38.090
N-Now that it's come to this, I'm gonna use it!

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:38.610
It?

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:42.810
Its name is <i>baritsu</i> ! It's a hand-to-hand technique taught to me by my grandfather!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:44.650
Next Time: The Secret of Baritsu!

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:47.820
The culprit is Kokoro! But why?!
